    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso",
        "text": "Mr. Rat King."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "Oh, it's you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034",
            "name2": "avg_npc_031",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso",
        "text": "What of them?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034",
            "name2": "avg_npc_031",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "I said as much, this city has no need of further bloodshed. If they can escape, let them escape."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "To miss your old master is noble. And you spent your loyalty to buy the rights of your fellows to live on. That was a charitable act. But you must not get greedy in your requests."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034",
            "name2": "avg_npc_031",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso",
        "text": "...Y- yeah. But after that, that was way out of step with Lungmen's rules..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_031",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "You learn quick."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "I have heard that long before Siracusa became what it is today, there was a time when the mafia there had some unwritten rules kept for survival's sake."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "The people obeyed them, the people accepted them, and in turbulent times, the mafia came to be the most trusted group in society."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "Then, they sold out, they traded in violence, and we came to where we are today."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "Lungmen has its laws, and I have my own code."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "Even Penguin Logistics has a set of rules for how they do whatever they want at all times, although they're all wildly different."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_031",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso",
        "text": "\u2014\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso",
        "text": "Mr. Rat King, if the boss back then... if Mr. Gambino didn't pull his sword on you the first time you met, would things still have turned out like this?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_031",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "I gave him a chance. Both before and after that moment. It was far more than just that."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "But from time to time, and especially in business, first impressions are very important. You understand?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034",
            "name2": "avg_npc_031",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso",
        "text": "...I understand."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
