    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "...*Pant pant*."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "There is... the exit! It's close!"
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 1,
            "xstrength": 8,
            "ystrength": 6,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "...Who's there?! Come out!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_027",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "So you ain't dead. That's a surprise. Turns out the Rat King ain't so thorough."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "...The wound you gave me still aches, Capone. I'm real glad you came to face me yourself."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "So I can kill you with my own hands."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "All of Lungmen's after us. I really don't wanna waste time on you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "So let's get this over with."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "You're gonna pay for betraying the Family..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "stopmusic",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "Haha. Family. Family, huh."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "That word sure brings me back. Hey, have either of you seen Texas?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_027#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "Th- that smell...!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "...a Lone Wolf. What are you doing in Lungmen?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_140_whitew_1",
            "fadetime": 2,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lappland",
        "text": "Well, Texas is here. Need I say more?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lappland",
        "text": "By the way, can you really call yourselves a 'Family' after you bolted from Siracusa to get away from all the responsibilities of being a Family? Can you still call yourselves 'Sicilian?'"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lappland",
        "text": "Would the one who plundered your proud and glorious history... Miss Sicilia herself, would she agree?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "Shut up! Don't ever speak of her in front of me!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "You're nothin' but a traitor! Who are you to call us..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_140_whitew_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lappland",
        "text": "That's enough, ass."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lappland",
        "text": "Oh, you're wounded? I smell blood. Wolf's blood. Mmm, is that what they call the smell of home?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lappland",
        "text": "Texas is different now, huh?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lappland",
        "text": "Really really different. A couple old friends from Siracusa come knocking on her door and she lets them leave Lungmen alive?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lappland",
        "text": "It's so inhospitable. Downright shameful. But it's okay, I'll finish the job for her."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lappland",
        "text": "Maybe if I bring her the corpses of a couple paisans from Siracusa that'll get her nice and worked up. Ooh, yeah, that's a great idea..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lappland",
        "text": "You think she can escape? From the shadow of her Family, I mean? From her past?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "...Capone, stand firm."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_027#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "Hah. Now we're gonna fight side by side? What happened to your honor and Family?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "Call it self-preservation."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_027#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "Hmph. You scared?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "Let's just say I don't want her to be the one who kills me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_027#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "...Good point. If I'm gonna die, I'd rather make it to an open casket."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_140_whitew_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lappland",
        "text": "Hahahaha! Are you trembling?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lappland",
        "text": "You're going to fight me when you can barely stand up straight?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lappland",
        "text": "All right, sure. Watching the life leave your eyes as you struggle to live sounds like a good time."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lappland",
        "text": "I'm going to count to ten."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lappland",
        "text": "Run."
    },
